  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Health Systems in Mykolaiv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will ensure the revival of the communities in Mykolaiv city and region through the reconstruction of the health care facilities that were damaged during the war and/or are in a dilapidated state. The project is implemented jointly with Novo Nordisk to support the refurbishment of health facilities in Mykolaiv. The Danish contribution will focus primarily on infrastructure, including the repairs of six health facilities; repairs of basements in four hospitals to serve as emergency shelters, and;  the installation of modular ambulatories.</narrative>
  </description>
